{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"印度尼西亚","country_iso":"IDN","created_at":"2026-03-23T11:14:52.795834","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"IDN-HB-0038","ldc":"No","location":"苏拉威西省东南地区","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"印度尼西亚KENDARI镍矿冶炼厂项目","project_name_en":"Indonesia KENDARI Nickel Smelter Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中建三局海外","content":"近日，中国建筑长江印尼有限公司与业主KKIT举行KENDARI镍矿冶炼项目框架合同签约仪式。\nKENDARI市市长Zulkairnain Kadir、中建三局国际公司（海外事业部）党委副书记、执行总经理汤立国受邀出席见证签约仪式。\n中建三局印尼联合国别组总经理付琦、业主代表ILAH LADAMAY分别代表双方签约\n项目简介\n该项目位于苏拉威西省东南地区，项目包括一个硫酸镍工厂，一个50MW的燃气发电厂，占地面积300公顷。项目建成后年产达17万吨硫酸镍、7400吨硫酸钴、6万吨硫酸锰，双方将致力把本项目打造成为印度尼西亚低碳、清洁的标杆镍矿冶炼厂及新能源汽车电池生产厂项目，并助力KENDARI工业园区成为东南苏拉威西省新的经济增长中心。","content_sha256":"ae02ef4e4b7b9adc505d8604ee79cbc4af40b8db23e4d58e82a0999b2d4c886d","id":16568,"publish_date":"2022-04-16 06:11:24","title":"中建长江印尼：KENDARI镍矿冶炼厂项目框架合同签约","title_sha256":"19c6c350c877cbadae64e60a866076b96bd2119264392c96a2f32d53dbc258f8","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/27700.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"IDN-HB-0038","capacity_details":"燃气发电厂: 50MW","capacity_mw":50.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"50","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T11:14:52.796627","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"IDN-HB-0038-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.stcn.com/article/detail/3676080.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"KKIT","project_developer_en":"KKIT","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中国建筑长江印尼有限公司与业主KKIT在印度尼西亚签约KENDARI镍矿冶炼项目框架合同。该项目将建设一个硫酸镍工厂和一